{577}{This is the Ring of Brodgar. Joachim told me that it was what the Panarii originally based their religion around, but it seems to have become unimportant, somehow. He was rather upset about it, as a matter of fact. Joachim's a bit of a purist, he is. I wish I could remember what its importance was...}{This is the Ring of Brodgar. Joachim told me that it was what the Panarii originally based their religion around, but it seems to have become unimportant, somehow. He was rather upset about it, as a matter of fact. Joachim's a bit of a purist, he is. I wish I could remember what its importance was...}{}{68}{}{}
