{831}{We need to find out who this "Renford A. Terwilliger" is. His name sounds familiar, but I can't seem to place it. He did...something that made him famous.}{We need to find out who this "Renford A. Terwilliger" is. His name sounds familiar, but I can't seem to place it. He did...something that made him famous.}{}{81}{}{}
{832}{K:}{}{1}{}{385}{}
{833}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
