{867}{Not again...look, SIR, my name is VIRGIL! [He struggles to compose himself.] We need to go speak with the leader of the Wheel Clan. Let's go, genius.}{Not again...look, MADAM, my name is VIRGIL! [He struggles to compose himself.] We need to go speak with the leader of the Wheel Clan. Let's go, genius.}{}{93}{}{}
