{1000}{Yes...I agree.  And I wish you'd stop going on about it, Magnus.  I mean, these dwarves...even for the undead they look a bit odd, misshapen or something.  And the stonework in this tomb is atrocious!  I'm not one to profane the dead, but I'd never claim these oddities as my 'lost people'...}{Yes...I agree.  And I wish you'd stop going on about it, Magnus.  I mean, these dwarves...even for the undead they look a bit odd, misshapen or something.  And the stonework in this tomb is atrocious!  I'm not one to profane the dead, but I'd never claim these oddities as my 'lost people'...}{}{94}{}{}
{1001}{You've got a point, Virgil...}{}{5}{}{-26}{}
{1002}{Easy, Virgil.  You're not helping the situation...}{}{5}{}{-26}{}

